{"ID":"20240118151109-e0wcj6q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151109-e0wcj6q","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151109-e0wcj6q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151109-n7ded57\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135418-qfpyw8w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135418-qfpyw8w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:283,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:283\u0026#125;","title":"220卫矛","type":"doc","updated":"20240201173344"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151109-n7ded57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151109-n7ded57","updated":"20240122135402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治女子崩中下血，腹满，汗出，除邪，杀鬼毒，蛊疰，生山谷。一名鬼箭。又名神箭。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135404-ewegm67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135404-ewegm67"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135406-wfhmxsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135406-wfhmxsj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦涩，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135408-r8bfsd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135408-r8bfsd7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为调经止痛要药，治女子崩中，产后腹绞痛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135410-r1f4u15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135410-r1f4u15"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主中恶腹痛，去白虫，消皮肤风毒肿。令阴中解。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135412-wdmylg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135412-wdmylg0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】破陈血，能落胎。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135413-9i08gny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135413-9i08gny"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】通月水，破症结，止血崩带下，杀腹臓虫，及产后血绞腹痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135415-2oswid4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135415-2oswid4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】疗妇人血气大效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135416-f96p7z6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135416-f96p7z6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135417-0tpq8uo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135417-0tpq8uo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】寒利者禁用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135402-g1mq75b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135402-g1mq75b"}},{"ID":"20240122135418-xzdtrs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135418-xzdtrs3"}},{"ID":"20240122135418-qfpyw8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135418-qfpyw8w","updated":"20240201173344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"220卫矛，是妇科用的，调经止疼，月经不顺，月经腹痛的时候会用到。卫矛很轻，2钱1钱，1钱2钱，味道是苦涩的药，是调经止痛使用的药。那我们中药里面调经的药很多，卫矛呢不是主力的药，像白芍、川芎、丹皮为主力的药。如果淤血比较严重的，我们就用桃仁呀红花呀，藏红花活血化於，很多人用桃红四物汤，当归川芎芍药熟地然后加上桃仁红花，那你说在加点卫矛这都无所谓的，次要的药。这些你看都是破陈血活血化於的药，通月水破症结，这个效果不错，一般来说药性是寒的，所以用得热症的时候使用。绝大多数太太月经痛是寒痛不是热痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"热痛的时候我们用卫矛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那寒痛的话你活血化於的药加进去你还要加一些去寒的药在里面，效果就会很好，比如加些炮附子呀，或者有必要加生附子，都可以的。"}]}]}